<title>USA: Cavalier Homes D.Roberson becomes CEO.</title>
<headline>Cavalier Homes D.Roberson becomes CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA FALLS, Texas 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cavalier Homes Inc said Thursday that its board has elected Chief Financial Officer David Roberson as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Roberson's position will be filled by Mike Murphy, who has been working under Roberson, the company said.</p>
<p>Roberson succeeds Cavalier founder Jerry Wilson, who died recently. Roberson joined Cavalier in 1984 and became chief financial officer in 1995, the company said.</p>
